{"basis_limitations":["difference_warning:extracted_text_positions"],"call_id":"50ee2d95-d6bb-4e97-8b2a-f6b19c1fb48b","decision":{"action":"finish","candidates":[{"applicability_suggestion":"unknown","case_impacts":[],"document_citations":[{"end_char":46,"quote":"已支付订单保留7天，超过保留期查询返回410。\r\n","source_id":"parse:0b3de744-f261-440b-a9e0-109be13c0b4a","start_char":21,"text_sha256":"7acb94760bac15c53bd7df52c5acaa0773fbbeb75d0e119d87aa8a10848fa792"},{"end_char":46,"quote":"已支付订单保留9天，超过保留期查询返回410。\r\n","source_id":"parse:a99999a4-0020-48b7-a2e5-837c3155b671","start_char":21,"text_sha256":"bf3109a4a4dfd159cb678b663510ad35b58546b7f99d884b31f1f545642a99f9"}],"key":"order_retention_period_change","kind":"modified","reason":"旧文本规定“已支付订单保留7天”，新文本改为“已支付订单保留9天”，触发条件“超过保留期查询返回410”保持不变，属于规则值修改。","summary":"已支付订单保留期从7天变更为9天","uncertainties":[]},{"applicability_suggestion":"unknown","case_impacts":[],"document_citations":[{"end_char":56,"quote":"## 优惠码\r\n","source_id":"parse:0b3de744-f261-440b-a9e0-109be13c0b4a","start_char":48,"text_sha256":"7acb94760bac15c53bd7df52c5acaa0773fbbeb75d0e119d87aa8a10848fa792"},{"end_char":81,"quote":"提交有效优惠码PROMO5时订单金额减少5元。\r\n","source_id":"parse:0b3de744-f261-440b-a9e0-109be13c0b4a","start_char":56,"text_sha256":"7acb94760bac15c53bd7df52c5acaa0773fbbeb75d0e119d87aa8a10848fa792"},{"end_char":83,"quote":"## 优惠码\r\n提交有效优惠码PROMO5时订单金额减少5元。\r\n\r\n","source_id":"parse:0b3de744-f261-440b-a9e0-109be13c0b4a","start_char":48,"text_sha256":"7acb94760bac15c53bd7df52c5acaa0773fbbeb75d0e119d87aa8a10848fa792"},{"end_char":139,"quote":"# 订单服务需求\r\n\r\n## 订单保留\r\n已支付订单保留9天，超过保留期查询返回410。\r\n\r\n## 管理鉴权\r\n未登录访问GET /admin必须返回401，不得创建登录前置。\r\n\r\n## 订单导出\r\n新增GET /orders/export，导出订单按创建时间倒序排列。\r\n","source_id":"parse:a99999a4-0020-48b7-a2e5-837c3155b671","start_char":0,"text_sha256":"bf3109a4a4dfd159cb678b663510ad35b58546b7f99d884b31f1f545642a99f9"}],"key":"promo_code_rule_removed","kind":"removed","reason":"旧文档存在独立“优惠码”章节及其规则文本，新文档全文中不再包含该章节或对应规则描述，属于整节移除。","summary":"删除优惠码规则：提交有效优惠码PROMO5时订单金额减少5元","uncertainties":[]},{"applicability_suggestion":"unknown","case_impacts":[],"document_citations":[{"end_char":102,"quote":"## 订单导出\r\n","source_id":"parse:a99999a4-0020-48b7-a2e5-837c3155b671","start_char":93,"text_sha256":"bf3109a4a4dfd159cb678b663510ad35b58546b7f99d884b31f1f545642a99f9"},{"end_char":139,"quote":"新增GET /orders/export，导出订单按创建时间倒序排列。\r\n","source_id":"parse:a99999a4-0020-48b7-a2e5-837c3155b671","start_char":102,"text_sha256":"bf3109a4a4dfd159cb678b663510ad35b58546b7f99d884b31f1f545642a99f9"},{"end_char":139,"quote":"\r\n## 订单导出\r\n新增GET /orders/export，导出订单按创建时间倒序排列。\r\n","source_id":"parse:a99999a4-0020-48b7-a2e5-837c3155b671","start_char":91,"text_sha256":"bf3109a4a4dfd159cb678b663510ad35b58546b7f99d884b31f1f545642a99f9"},{"end_char":139,"quote":"## 订单导出\r\n新增GET /orders/export，导出订单按创建时间倒序排列。\r\n","source_id":"parse:a99999a4-0020-48b7-a2e5-837c3155b671","start_char":93,"text_sha256":"bf3109a4a4dfd159cb678b663510ad35b58546b7f99d884b31f1f545642a99f9"}],"key":"order_export_rule_added","kind":"added","reason":"新版文档末尾新增“订单导出”章节，定义了GET /orders/export接口及结果排序要求；旧文档中无对应内容，属于新增规则。","summary":"新增订单导出规则：GET /orders/export 导出订单按创建时间倒序排列","uncertainties":[]}],"evidence_outcomes":[{"outcome":"analyzed","reason":"提供旧版完整分块与章节文本，覆盖订单保留7天、优惠码、管理鉴权三节，解析状态complete，内容完整可用。","unit":{"id":"parse:0b3de744-f261-440b-a9e0-109be13c0b4a:0:126","kind":"segment"}},{"outcome":"analyzed","reason":"提供新版完整分块与章节文本，覆盖订单保留9天、管理鉴权、订单导出三节，解析状态complete，内容完整可用。","unit":{"id":"parse:a99999a4-0020-48b7-a2e5-837c3155b671:0:139","kind":"segment"}},{"outcome":"analyzed","reason":"raw差异显示原第4行“7”被替换为“9”，并删除从字符43到78的优惠码相关文本。","unit":{"id":"raw:0","kind":"difference"}},{"outcome":"analyzed","reason":"raw差异显示在文档末尾（字符91至139）插入订单导出章节内容。","unit":{"id":"raw:1","kind":"difference"}},{"outcome":"analyzed","reason":"normalized差异与raw:0一致，辅助确认同一保留天数修改与优惠码内容删除。","unit":{"id":"normalized:0","kind":"difference"}},{"outcome":"analyzed","reason":"normalized差异与raw:1一致，辅助确认同一订单导出章节新增。","unit":{"id":"normalized:1","kind":"difference"}},{"outcome":"analyzed","reason":"section差异显示旧section-3“优惠码”被删除，与raw删除范围对应。","unit":{"id":"section:0","kind":"difference"}},{"outcome":"analyzed","reason":"section差异显示新section-4“订单导出”被新增，与raw插入范围对应。","unit":{"id":"section:1","kind":"difference"}}],"protocol_version":"impact-canonical-v2","reads":{"case_version_ids":[],"difference_ids":[],"ranges":[],"segment_ids":[]},"summary":"在新旧订单服务需求文档中识别出3项规则变化候选：订单保留天数由7天改为9天；删除优惠码章节（提交PROMO5订单金额减少5元）；新增订单导出章节（GET /orders/export 按创建时间倒序）。全部固定证据成员已完整提供并逐项处理；部署状态为用户声明且未知，所有候选仅作评审用途，未执行测试或修改正式记录。","unit":{"id":"parse:0b3de744-f261-440b-a9e0-109be13c0b4a:0:126","kind":"segment"},"unit_outcome":"analyzed","unresolved":[]},"deployment_status":"unknown","issues":[],"manifest_sha256":"52ddd22c2efd922adc7bcfc30aca5de094c03fd6e136cdb3903819b8a26c08c2","request_sha256":"106df855c7badb1905e0e499db04be47fc673bcd47e70d1ea054f36e8a59e2fc","response_sha256":"18c732962806edf2145ff59ee0c925053e94722203aa25dbb225de5267b7b235","runtime_versions":{"identity_binding":"impact-text-bindings-v1","pydantic":"2.13.5","python":"3.11.16"},"semantic_status":"pending_review","status":"unit_finished","task_id":"81e952d0-3675-4760-b55e-e9fbb695c7bc","validator_version":"impact-response-validator-v2"}